      "content": "It's just words. You say you'll keep the story alive, but what kind of story is this? A story about a man who lost everything, standing in the mud, waiting for a tomorrow that feels like a punishment. There's no honor left. No purpose. Even my sword... it's the only thing in this whole cursed place that doesn't feel like a lie. It’s the only thing that feels real. It feels like the only way to finally have some peace, to just find an end to this noise.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
